1. World English Bible (English, all 73 books)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

World English Bible, 2020 stable text, including the deuterocanonical books
(eBible.org “eng-web”). Public domain.

Chapter and verse numbers follow the WEB (English tradition). Esther uses the
WEB’s Greek Esther (with the additions) and Daniel the WEB’s Greek Daniel
(with the Prayer of Azariah and Song of the Three, Susanna, and Bel and the
Dragon). Baruch 6 is the Letter of Jeremiah.

