2. STEPBible TAHOT, TAGNT, TBESH, and TBESG
     © Tyndale House, Cambridge / STEPBible.org
     Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Source:  https://github.com/STEPBible/STEPBible-Data
         https://stepbible.org

Used here:

  • TAHOT (Translators Amalgamated Hebrew OT) — Hebrew and Aramaic Old
    Testament word-level text, morphology (ETCBC parsing in OpenScriptures
    / OSHB code format), extended Strong’s lemmas, English glosses,
