  • TBESH (Hebrew/Aramaic) and TBESG (Greek) — brief lexicons. Definitions
    are shortened to about 300 characters. Occurrence counts are computed
    in this app from the Hebrew OT and Greek NT texts used here (not from
    the LXX or Targum).

